{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgkeawqkvUzk5jsNc2UP3","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I'd tell my friend: it costs me up to 10 ₪ a month if I'm on the basic track. I think there's a new rule coming with different prices, up to 5 or 10 ₪ depending on how many transactions, but I didn't get it. As for how much to keep in it, only what might go out today. Anything above 15,000 ₪ is too much, so out of my 30,000 most should go somewhere else, maybe the \"קרן כספית יומית\" the page points to. I'm fairly sure about the \"keep little there\" part and unsure about the fee. What decided it was the box saying 10,000 ₪ sitting there for 10 years is worth 8,203 ₪, \"1,797 ₪ פחות\".\n\n**How it went:**\n- **First screen:** The heading \"חשבון עובר ושב\" was exactly what I came for. The \"מה זה\" part had the fee: \"המסלול הבסיסי… עד 10.00 ₪ בחודש\". Then a paragraph with two dates, 01.10.2026 and 01.07.2027, and fees of \"5.00 ₪… 10.00 ₪… 1.00 ₪\". I couldn't tell which rule applies to me now and which one later.\n- **Second screen:** The top of \"כמה כסף להחזיק בעו\"ש\" got cut off between screens. I only caught \"כסף שעשוי לצאת היום נשאר בעו\"ש\" and the 15,000 ₪ line. Then the calculator box. I'd have typed my 30,000 in the \"יתרה בעו\"ש\" field, but I only had pictures.\n- **Third screen:** Three big numbers: 8,203, 10,779 and \"המחיר של להשאיר 2,576 ₪\". I got confused here, because a screen ago it said 1,797 less, and now it's 2,576. I guessed the 2,576 is compared to the money fund. I didn't open the folds (\"חלק מהבנקים כן משלמים ריבית…\", \"שחקו עם המספרים שלכם\").\n- **Fourth screen:** \"שווה לדעת\" said 4 of 8 banks pay some interest, only up to 10,000 ₪. Then \"סיכונים\": \"אין בישראל ביטוח פיקדונות\". That scared me a bit about keeping a lot in the bank.\n- I stopped at \"מונחים\" and didn't open the fifth screen. It's just a glossary.\n\n**Words I didn't get:** מק\"מ, הטבה בנקאית, נגיד/מנהל מורשה, the BANK-17-style tags, and the dotted underlines on numbers.\n\n**What I'd change:**\n- Make the new fee rule with the dates simple: what I pay now and what I'll pay later.\n- Don't show two different \"you lose\" numbers.\n- Put the 15,000 line at the top of its section, where you can't miss it."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1933,"cache_read_input_tokens":10168,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1933},"output_tokens":5,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"456a29a6-5e48-4511-aac3-bff3c8bff923","uuid":"346cca21-77d0-4ce9-b384-f7733451e9c5","timestamp":"2026-11-05T23:28:28.264Z","request_id":"req_011CgkeaweMGAPHDciKjXtJm"}
